{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>והתהלכתי</b> Two times in the Masorah: והתהלכתי בתוככם. והתהלכתי באמתך בזכות והתהלכתי באמתך והתהלכתי בתוככם. From אם בחקותי through קוממיות, every letter of the alphabet except samekh and pe. And likewise in ויתן לך, samekh and pe are missing, for there is no Satan, nor anger, nor wrath, nor plague, nor fury in these blessings."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {0 "The phrase 'והתהלכתי באמתך בזכות' appears to introduce the two cited occurrences with a prefixed 'בזכות' (in the merit of); translated hyper-literally as the structure is textually dense. The words שטן, אף, קצף, נגף, אנף all begin with samekh or pe, explaining why those letters' absence signals their absence."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:45.736694679Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}